{"sourceUrl":"https://zhwx.ecnu.edu.cn/c3/b6/c28583a770998/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:18.353892+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://zhwx.ecnu.edu.cn/c3/b6/c28583a770998/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span><span> 我</span></span><span><span><span>系</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span><span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读</span></span><span><span><span>硕士</span></span></span><span><span>研究生，现将预报名工作安排通知如下：</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span> 一、报名条件</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党领导，遵纪守法、品德良好；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>已获得或预计获得就读学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>学习成绩优异，具有较强的创新意识、研究潜质和专业基础；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span>身心健康，符合国家规定的体检要求</span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span> 二、报名流程</span></span></p><p><span><span> （一）时间及方式</span></span></p><p><span><span> 有意申请的考生即日起可登录华东师范大学研究生报考服务系统（</span></span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=5</a></span></span></span></span><span><span>，以下简称报名系统）注册账号，</span></span><span><span><span>并于</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>23</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>前</span></span></span><span><span>填写并提交申请志愿。</span></span></p><p><span><span> 每位考生最多可注册两个账号，填报两条独立志愿。在</span></span><span><span><span>我</span></span></span><span><span>系规定报名截止时间</span></span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>23</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span><span><span>前，考生可自行取消提交状态、修改完善后再次提交。</span></span></p><p><span><span> （二）报名材料</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>有效居民身份证；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>教育部学籍在线验证报告；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>预报名申请表（报名系统填写完毕后下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span>诚信承诺书（报名系统下载打印、签字后扫描上传）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span>其他材料</span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span><span>包括本科学习成绩单、外语能力证明、获奖证书及其他能反映研究能力和创新潜质的材料，</span></span><span><span><span>请合并为一个</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>文件上传，文件</span></span></span><span><span>大小不超过</span></span><span><span><span><span>10MB</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span> 三、其他说明</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>考生</span></span></span><span><span>须保证提交材料真实、准确，不得弄虚作假，不得有学术不端行为。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>考生</span></span></span><span><span>须密切关注报名系统中的审核状态及院系复试通知等信息。</span></span><span><span><span>我</span></span></span><span><span>系将在院系研究生招生工作小组的领导下成立材料审核专家组，对申请材料进行审核并确认是否接收申请，并根据上级部门和学校政策规范组织复试考核工作。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>报名系统中展示的学科专业及研究方向仅供参考，我校</span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span><span><span>年推免专业目录最终以全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统（网址：</span></span><span><span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/index.jsp</span></span></span></span><span><span>，以下简称推免服务系统）公布为准。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span>除预报名外，所有通过推荐免试方式攻读我</span></span><span><span><span>系</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span><span><span>年研究生的考生均须在正式取得推免资格后，在推免服务系统履行填写报考志愿、接收并确认院系的复试及待录取通知等正式程序。推免服务系统正式开放时间请及时关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span>错过预报名的考生如仍有意愿报考我</span></span><span><span><span>系</span></span></span><span><span>，可在推免服务系统开通后直接报名。</span></span><span><span><span>我</span></span></span><span><span>系将结合实际，确定是否再次组织推免复试考核与录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span></span><span><span>若上级部门对推免招生工作有新的要求，</span></span><span><span><span>我系</span></span></span><span><span>将遵照执行。</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span> 四、咨询方式</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>学硕联系人：</strong></span></span><span><span>吴老师  </span></span><span><span><span>         </span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 联系电话：</span></span><span><span><span><span>021-54345081</span></span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>happyhan1987@163.com</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>创意写作专业联系人